  "id": "professional-standards",
  "term": "professional standards",
  "definition": "Professional standards are the expectations that graduates or practitioners should meet to show they are competent and ready to deliver high-quality, patient-centered care. In educational settings, assessment is used to check whether these standards and the required range of practice abilities have been achieved.",
